<%@ page language="java" contentType="text/html; charset=UTF-8" pageEncoding="UTF-8"%>
<%@ taglib prefix="c" uri="jakarta.tags.core" %>
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>너와 나의 연결고리 - 메인</title>

    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Material+Symbols+Outlined" rel="stylesheet">
    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/orioncactus/pretendard/dist/web/static/pretendard.css" rel="stylesheet">

    <link rel="stylesheet" href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/css/common/common.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/css/mainpage.css">
</head>
<body>

    <jsp:include page="/view/common/header.jsp" />

    <main class="main-page">
        <section class="hero-section">
            <div class="layout-container">
                <div class="hero-box">
                    <div class="hero-text-wrap">
                        <span class="hero-badge">MAIN</span>
                        <h1 class="hero-title">
                        사랑으로 잇는<br> 
                        너와 나의 연결고리
                        </h1>
                        <p class="hero-description">
                            유기동물에게 따뜻한 가족이 되어주세요.<br>
                            여러분의 작은 관심이 생명을 살리는 기적이 됩니다.
                        </p>

                        <div class="hero-buttons">
                            <a href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/animal/animalList.do" class="main-btn main-btn-primary">입양하기</a>
                            <a href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/donation/form.do" class="main-btn main-btn-secondary">후원하기</a>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="hero-image-wrap">
                        <img src="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/images/main-hero.jpg" alt="메인 배너">
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="intro-section">
            <div class="layout-container">
                <div class="section-head">
                    <h2>함께 참여해주세요</h2>
                    <p>도움이 필요한 유기동물들에게 당신의 손길을 내밀어주세요.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="intro-card-grid">
                    <article class="intro-card">
                        <div class="intro-card-icon">
                            <span class="material-symbols-outlined">volunteer_activism</span>
                        </div>
                        <h3>봉사활동</h3>
                        <p>아이들과 함께 시간을 보내주세요.</p>
                        <a href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/volunteer/list.do">자세히 보기</a>
                    </article>

                    <article class="intro-card">
                        <div class="intro-card-icon">
                            <span class="material-symbols-outlined">menu_book</span>
                        </div>
                        <h3>입양 가이드</h3>
                        <p>입양 절차를 확인하세요.</p>
                        <a href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/animal/guide.do">가이드 보기</a>
                    </article>

                    <article class="intro-card">
                        <div class="intro-card-icon">
                            <span class="material-symbols-outlined">favorite</span>
                        </div>
                        <h3>입양 후기</h3>
                        <p>행복한 이야기들을 확인하세요.</p>
                        <a href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/board/review.do">후기 보기</a>
                    </article>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>
    </main>

    <jsp:include page="/view/common/footer.jsp" />

</body>
</html>